## Use of this site

The content on this site — dated news and release-date articles about upcoming games, and PC game profile pages that link to official store listings — is provided for general informational purposes. Each article states when its sources were checked. We make a good-faith effort to keep it accurate, but we don't guarantee that every detail (such as a release date, platform list, edition, or price) is still current, because publishers and stores change that information outside our control. Check the linked official page before you buy.

## No official affiliation

Unless an article explicitly says otherwise, this site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the developers, publishers, or stores of the games we write about. Game names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.

## External links

We link to official store listings and publisher websites. We aren't responsible for the content, policies, or practices of those external sites.

## Advertising

This site may display advertising served by third parties, including Google. See our [Privacy Policy](/privacy) for how that affects data collection.

## Changes to these terms

We may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.

## Contact

The [Contact page](/contact) names the publisher. Questions can be sent to [hamzahanifadsense@gmail.com](mailto:hamzahanifadsense@gmail.com).
